=== control: comment in body paragraph
"body text\n\nnote here\n" comments=1
=== comment in cell, then paragraph after table
"| cell text |\n| --- |\n\nafter\n" comments=1
=== comment in second paragraph of a cell
"| a<br>b |\n| --- |\n" comments=1
=== continue-numbering (3 items, then 1 more)
"1) item 1\n2) item 2\n3) item 3\n\nmid\n\n1. after\n" comments=0
=== continue-list by id
"1) item 1\n2) item 2\n\nmid\n\n1. after\n" comments=0
=== empty middle item (Word-like expectation 3)
"1) one\n2) three\n" comments=0
